  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, the parabola&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So, point is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></math> Differentiate given equation w.r.t. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8242;</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"\" separators=\"|\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8242;</mi></msup></mfenced><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So, the equation of tangent at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/0a31cad0-b18a-48b6-a436-3fd3607fd023-image.png\" style=\"width: 337px; height: 276px;\" /></p><p>Required area &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>[</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>]</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math><br />Required area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></math><br />Required area <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>3</mn></msubsup></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Required area<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math>sq units</p>",
